  "note": "City is already in ir, which left the watcher and proposed noun of agitation here. No token key for agitation: p.bp.ab would assign it hundreds of cities. The skin count includes Beor by spelling. Both blindness nouns draw on the same three tokens: p.bo.ad is omitted. Hab 3:9 is disputed. The connection between chaff, hide, and nakedness is unclear; the cognates support individual meanings. Syriac lexeme 2285 and the wakeful adjective 2311 lack NT occurrences in SEDRA. Syriac verbal and adjectival uses are anchored to lexemes 2282–2284 and 2310. The Er, Eri, Eran and Jaur names are compared by form; none has an explicit naming explanation."
